# --- Sensitive inputs must never enter this public repository ---------------
# The model runs against access-controlled INRB case data. Nothing derived from
# individual records belongs here; only the allowlisted, zone-aggregated outputs
# produced by tools/filter_public_outputs.sh.
data/
*linelist*
*ctsafe*
id_lookup*
dhis2_processed*
*_pairwise_import_force.csv

# Manuscript drafts and reviews (mirrors the analysis repo's rules)
MANUSCRIPT*
BDBV_LID*
LID_MANUSCRIPT_REVIEW.md
REVIEW_FINDINGS*.md
REVIEW_RESPONSE*.md

# Local pipeline run products — published outputs arrive via CI, not by hand
spatiotemporal/outputs/
backup_outputs_*/

# R
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj
Rplots.pdf
*.rds

# Stan / cmdstanr build artefacts
*.stan.o
*_model
cmdstan/

# Editors, OS, tooling
.DS_Store
.Rapp.history
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
*.bak
*~
